      <text>
        <locale_1033>ToggleLayerPointer</locale_1033>
      </text>
      <tooltip>
        <locale_1033>Displays quick layer information for visible objects.

Creates a filtered layer list showing only layers with visible objects.
Useful for examining and understanding model layer structure.
</locale_1033>
